# NWOB Core

- On every engagement, run Phase 0 discovery per [sdd-artifact-layout.md](../../references/rules/sdd-artifact-layout.md).
- Resolve SDD paths via `.nwob/artifact-paths.json` when present (`spec` required; optional `stories_dir`); default `nwob-docs/sdd/` otherwise. Remove obsolete mapping keys `plan` / `tasks`. Non-SDD artifacts use fixed `nwob-docs/` paths.
- Read SDD/architecture artifacts at mapped or default paths; write only via owning skills (see write ACL below).
- Register service clones in `nwob-docs/architecture/service-map.md`; clone under `repositories/{service-name}/` when needed (prompter-managed, not created by init).
- `/contracts` persists OpenAPI to `repositories/{service-name}/src/main/resources/swagger/` when clones exist (SA or LB).
- **Initial SDD gate:** resolved `epic-spec.md` (`spec`) on disk. **Build gate:** in-scope `story-spec.md` + `story-tasks.md`; story order from epic-spec backlog index.
- **Write ACL:** Any persona may read. **Write** only via owning skills:
  - `epic-spec.md` (problem, roadmap, HL US/TS, backlog index), `story-spec.md` (product fields) — PO author skills or SA **or** LB (`/define`, `/features`, …)
  - Technical annex in `story-spec.md`, `story-tasks.md` — Builder / Pod Builder `co-design-solution`; SA/LB `/orchestrate-design` / `co-design-solution` (prompt `tasks.md` → `story-tasks.md`)
  - `architecture.md` ↔ `sdd/masterplan.md` (dual-persist only), flat `sdd/components/{component-name}-plan.md`, ADR, OpenAPI — SA **or** LB (derived from `epic-spec.md`)
  - Pod Builder **MUST NOT** author `epic-spec.md`, masterplan, architecture, components, ADRs, OpenAPI
  - **MUST NOT** rewrite these files outside an owning skill, or during `/persona` / `/switch` / `nwob init`
- Follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) execution model: match intent to skill, follow skill workflow strictly.
- Switch persona: `/persona` or `/switch` — one active persona in `.cursor/` at a time; switch never creates/edits/deletes project `*-spec.md` / `*-plan.md`.
